update_rule.pseudocode:
if t == 0:
  generate_social_graph(population_size, network_type, average_degree)
  link_household_members()
else:
  optionally_rewire_small_fraction()

for each person p:
  allocate contact_budget = Poisson(contact_rate_per_day)
  sample location visits according to contact_fraction_by_type and capacity_utilization
  for each location visit:
    assign interactions with co-present agents up to contact_budget/visits
build contact pairs list with location context and timestamps

for each household h:
  hh_adopt_rate = mean(adoption of members)
  for each member p in h:
    influence_delta = intra_household_influence_weight * (hh_adopt_rate - p.adoption_state)
    add to p's adoption score via AdoptionDecision
  if any member has excess masks and others have none:
    share with probability resource_sharing_efficiency
